다이어트를 시켜주는 게","start":153.20000076293945,"end":155.0,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0016","text":"아이들한테는 훨씬 실질적인 도움이 돼요.","start":155.0,"end":157.79999923706055,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0017","text":"그래서 특정 부위를 좋아지게 만들려고","start":157.79999923706055,"end":160.4000015258789,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0018","text":"좋고 비싼 영양제를 쫓아다니는 거는","start":160.4000015258789,"end":163.20000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0019","text":"어쩌면 우리 보호자님들이","start":163.20000076293945,"end":165.0,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0020","text":"불안한 마음을 달래는 그런 임시방편일지도 모릅니다.","start":165.0,"end":168.20000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0021","text":"그래서 제가 논문도 찾아보고","start":168.20000076293945,"end":170.0999984741211,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0022","text":"교수님들, 의사 선생님들, 수의사 선생님들 찾아다니면서","start":170.0999984741211,"end":173.4000015258789,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0023","text":"물어보고 하면서 제가 진짜 치열하게 공부를 열심히 했는데요.","start":173.4000015258789,"end":177.0,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0024","text":"도대체 눈앞에 증상만 가려주는 임시방편 영양제 말고","start":177.0,"end":181.70000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0025","text":"아이들에게 진짜 필요한 게 무엇일까?","start":181.70000076293945,"end":184.3000030517578,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0026","text":"장수한 아이들 보호자분들이 하나같이 챙겼던 게","start":184.3000030517578,"end":187.8000030517578,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0027","text":"딱 3가지가 있더라고요.","start":187.8000030517578,"end":189.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0028","text":"그래서 반려동물 뿐만 아니라","start":189.5,"end":191.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0029","text":"사람들 만나도, 아니면 심지어 우리 가족들을 만나도","start":191.5,"end":194.4000015258789,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0030","text":"건강을 위해서 꼭 챙기라고 말씀드리는 것이 바로","start":194.4000015258789,"end":197.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0031","text":"황산화, 간, 그리고 유산균입니다.","start":197.5,"end":200.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0032","text":"몸 전체가 늙고 노화되는 걸 막아주고","start":200.5,"end":203.5999984741211,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0033","text":"면역력을 탄탄하게 쌓아서","start":203.5999984741211,"end":206.0,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0034","text":"우리가 먹는 영양소가 몸속에 쭉쭉 흡수되도록 만들어줘야","start":206.0,"end":210.3000030517578,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0035","text":"아이가 스스로 질병을 이겨내는 힘이 생기는 거거든요.","start":210.3000030517578,"end":213.6999969482422,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0036","text":"그래서 우리 몸의 뿌리 역할을 하는 장, 그리고 대사 시스템과","start":213.6999969482422,"end":218.4000015258789,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0037","text":"해독을 책임지는 간을 튼튼하게 만들어줘야 되는 겁니다.","start":218.4000015258789,"end":222.1999969482422,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0038","text":"나무도 뿌리가 썩어가면 이파리에 아무리 영양제 좋은 거 발라봤자","start":222.1999969482422,"end":226.3000030517578,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0039","text":"소용이 없는 것처럼 똑같거든요.","start":226.3000030517578,"end":227.5999984741211,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0040","text":"그런데 문제는 막상 우리 아이들이 장건강, 간건강 좀 제대로 챙겨주려고","start":227.5999984741211,"end":233.6999969482422,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0041","text":"그 시중의 제품들을 검색해보면","start":233.6999969482422,"end":235.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0042","text":"정말 한숨부터 푹 나옵니다.","start":235.5,"end":237.4000015258789,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0001-0043","text":"이상하게 반려동물용이라는 이름표만 탁 붙어있어요.","start":237.4000015258789,"end":240,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0000","text":"반려동물용이라는 이름표만 탁 붙으면","start":238,"end":240.75999999046326,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":true},{"id":"0002-0001","text":"가격이 터무니없이 비싸져요.","start":240.75999999046326,"end":242.32000017166138,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0002","text":"금가루를 넣은 것도 아닌데 말이죠.","start":242.32000017166138,"end":243.80000019073486,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0003","text":"게다가 돈이 비싸도 제대로 만들었으면 말을 안 하죠.","start":243.80000019073486,"end":247.23999977111816,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0004","text":"아마 뉴스 보신 분들은 다 아실 거예요.","start":247.23999977111816,"end":249.3400001525879,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0005","text":"한국소비자원에서 시판되는 반려동물 영양제들을 수거해서","start":249.3400001525879,"end":254.02000045776367,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0006","text":"조사해봤더니 기가 막히게도","start":254.02000045776367,"end":256.1200008392334,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0007","text":"표시된 성분 함량에 한참 못 미치거나","start":256.1200008392334,"end":258.73999977111816,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0008","text":"심지어는 아예 검출되지 않는 제품까지 무더기로 적발됐습니다.","start":258.73999977111816,"end":263.23999977111816,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0009","text":"우리는 아예 오래 살리겠다고 그 비싼 돈을 지불해가면서","start":263.23999977111816,"end":267.20000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0010","text":"눈물겹게 먹였는데","start":267.20000076293945,"end":268.6800003051758,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0011","text":"그냥 공기를 먹은 셈이랑 똑같은 거죠.","start":268.6800003051758,"end":270.939998626709,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0012","text":"내 눈으로 성분표를 보고도 믿을 수가 없는 게","start":270.939998626709,"end":273.54000091552734,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0013","text":"지금 동물용 영양제 시장에 너무라도 씁쓸한 현실입니다.","start":273.54000091552734,"end":277.20000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0014","text":"그래서 똑똑한 보호자님들은 결국 어디로 눈을 돌릴까요?","start":277.20000076293945,"end":280.3400001525879,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0015","text":"바로 사람용 영양제입니다.","start":280.3400001525879,"end":282.54000091552734,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0016","text":"그래서 일부 보호자분들 사이에서는","start":282.54000091552734,"end":285.1599998474121,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0017","text":"이미 아름아름 퍼지고 있는 방법이 있어요.","start":285.1599998474121,"end":287.9199981689453,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0018","text":"바로 사람용 영양제 중에서","start":287.9199981689453,"end":290.3400001525879,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0019","text":"강아지가 먹어도 되는 제품을 골라서","start":290.3400001525879,"end":293.060001373291,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0020","text":"체중에 맞게 소분해서 먹이는 겁니다.","start":293.060001373291,"end":295.45999908447266,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0021","text":"예를 들면 항산화는 코엔자인 Q10이나 비타민 A, 비타민 E 같은 거.","start":295.45999908447266,"end":299.7200012207031,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0022","text":"단보호는 밀크시슬이나 아미노산 같은 성분들인데요.","start":299.7200012207031,"end":303.04000091552734,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0023","text":"이 성분들은 수의사들도 강아지에게 활용하는 검증된 원료들이에요.","start":303.04000091552734,"end":307.55999755859375,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0024","text":"그런데 굳이 왜 귀찮게 사람용을 쓰냐?","start":307.55999755859375,"end":310.3199996948242,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0025","text":"사람용 제품은 대량 생산을 하기 때문에","start":310.3199996948242,"end":313.05999755859375,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0026","text":"동물평원에서 파는 것과는 완전히 똑같은 성분인데도","start":313.05999755859375,"end":316.6999969482422,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0027","text":"가격은 최소 4배 이상 저렴한 경우가 많습니다.","start":316.6999969482422,"end":319.6600036621094,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0028","text":"실제로 서울신문조사에서도 반려동물 영양제가","start":319.6600036621094,"end":322.9199981689453,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0029","text":"동일한 성분의 사람용 제품보다 최대 4.5배 비싸다고 해요.","start":322.9199981689453,"end":327.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0030","text":"사람용이 1만 원이면 반려동물이 4만 5천 원인 셈인데","start":327.5,"end":331.23999786376953,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0031","text":"차이가 진짜 많이 납니다.","start":331.23999786376953,"end":332.76000213623047,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0032","text":"그래서 발빠른 보호자분들이 사람용을 구해서","start":332.76000213623047,"end":335.54000091552734,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0033","text":"아이들에게 급여하시는 분들이 생겨난 거예요.","start":335.54000091552734,"end":337.7799987792969,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0034","text":"그런데 막상 해보면 진짜 보통일이 아닙니다.","start":337.7799987792969,"end":340.6600036621094,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0035","text":"이 소분이 너무 힘들어요.","start":340.6600036621094,"end":342.76000213623047,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0036","text":"아이들 체중에 맞게 밀리그램 단위로 쪼개고","start":342.76000213623047,"end":346.36000061035156,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0037","text":"캡슐을 까고 저울에 올리는 게","start":346.36000061035156,"end":348.37999725341797,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0038","text":"그 바쁜 아침에 매일매일 하다 보면","start":348.37999725341797,"end":351.2200012207031,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0039","text":"어느 순간 진짜 스트레스예요.","start":351.23999786376953,"end":353.5800018310547,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0040","text":"그래서 미리 일주일 치를 만들어 놓기도 했는데","start":353.5800018310547,"end":355.9000015258789,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0002-0041","text":"중요한 거는 이 밀리그램 단위가 진짜 얼마 안 되거든요.","start":355.9000015258789,"end":359.9800033569336,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0000","text":"단위가 진짜 얼마 안 되거든요.","start":358,"end":360.2000000476837,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":true},{"id":"0003-0001","text":"정밀한 저울이 필요해요.","start":360.2000000476837,"end":361.40000009536743,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0002","text":"정확한 정밀 저울은 비싸서 저도 싼 거 사서 해봤는데","start":361.40000009536743,"end":365.19999980926514,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0003","text":"진짜 쉽지가 않더라고요.","start":365.19999980926514,"end":366.6000003814697,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0004","text":"근데 이게 진짜 중요한 문제였었어요.","start":366.6000003814697,"end":368.69999980926514,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0005","text":"용량을 잘못 계산하면 오히려 이게 독이 되거든요.","start":368.69999980926514,"end":371.5,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0006","text":"사람 기준 이 한 알이 강아지 체중 대비로는","start":371.5,"end":374.6000003814697,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0007","text":"과다 용량이 돼서 특히 지용성인 성분들은","start":374.6000003814697,"end":379.1000003814697,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0008","text":"매일 조금씩 쌓이다가 간이랑 신장에 부담이 생길 수 있거든요.","start":379.1000003814697,"end":382.20000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0009","text":"그래서 성분 하나하나 공부하고","start":382.20000076293945,"end":384.20000076293945,"timestamp_status":null,"boundary_overlap":false},{"id":"0003-0010","text":"체중 환산하면서 정확하게 해야 되는데","start":38